  "sourceTitle": "Data Is Better Together: A Look Back and Forward",
  "sourceBodyHash": "0b0758215e2c14e72c801c027f747b7685a16201208557c792fa9f41b1be6f70",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T02:47:56.474617Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T01:40:49.612009Z",
  "totalBlocks": 25,
  "translatedBlocks": 25,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15878adf19f0a697",
      "translationZh": "过去几个月里，我们一直在推进 Data Is Better Together 倡议。通过 Hugging Face 与 Argilla 的合作，以及开源机器学习社区的支持，我们的目标一直是让开源社区能够共同创建具有影响力的数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3a5d65d225dded4",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们决定继续朝着同一个目标前进。为了概述我们取得的成果以及每个人都可以参与的任务，我们将其分为两个部分：社区工作和实用指南工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a6e6fbc2911bbc3c",
      "translationZh": "社区工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83e1dfc2825e221d",
      "translationZh": "这项倡议最初的工作集中在提示词排序项目上。我们的目标是创建一个包含 10K 条提示词的数据集，其中既有合成的提示词，也有人工编写的提示词，并按质量排序。社区立即给予了响应！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "528979e40ef05dba",
      "translationZh": "短短几天内，就有超过 385 人加入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9a3e45137545c806",
      "translationZh": "我们发布了 DIBT/10k_prompts_ranked 数据集，用于提示词排序任务或合成数据生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7dcb233c0e8506b",
      "translationZh": "该数据集被用于构建新模型，例如 SPIN。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35001accb9310c7c",
      "translationZh": "看到来自全球社区的支持，我们意识到，仅有以英语为中心的数据是不够的，而且针对开放大语言模型的特定语言基准测试还不够多。因此，我们创建了多语言提示词评估项目（MPEP），旨在为多种语言建立排行榜。为此，我们从 DIBT/10k_prompts_ranked 中选取了一个包含 500 条高质量提示词的子集，以便将其翻译成不同语言。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "92bfff638b5836d5",
      "translationZh": "超过 18 位语言负责人创建了用于翻译的空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6f423e654a5cd532",
      "translationZh": "已完成荷兰语、俄语或西班牙语的翻译，还有更多工作正在推进，力求完成所有提示词的翻译。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d1589f9eabff32fa",
      "translationZh": "在 Discord 上创建了一个数据集构建者社区",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01f1fa68216d6db4",
      "translationZh": "今后，我们将继续通过工具和文档，支持社区围绕数据集构建开展的工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dbc22e772abb3cec",
      "translationZh": "实用指南编写工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "194dcbe9ac61413f",
      "translationZh": "作为 DIBT 的一部分，我们还创建了指南和工具，帮助社区自主构建有价值的数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "300ef82fddcd2cdf",
      "translationZh": "领域专用数据集：汇集工程师和领域专家，推动创建更多用于训练模型的领域专用数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "774377b02298ab8f",
      "translationZh": "DPO/ORPO 数据集：帮助培育一个社区，让人们为不同语言、领域和任务构建更多 DPO 风格的数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8784b6f77c0a5a5",
      "translationZh": "KTO 数据集：帮助社区创建自己的 KTO 数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1cc37f879a82c6fb",
      "translationZh": "我们学到了什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4d909e0e6f36d769",
      "translationZh": "社区渴望参与这些工作，并对共同构建数据集充满热情。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bfe2f0f0a4161c06",
      "translationZh": "要确保基准全面且具有包容性，就必须克服现存的不平等。目前，开源社区中某些语言、领域和任务的数据集仍然不足。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "19d0cde7e2294827",
      "translationZh": "我们已经拥有许多必要的工具，能够支持社区有效协作，构建有价值的数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d6e3364d00597256",
      "translationZh": "你可以如何参与？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7983a3633983dd62",
      "translationZh": "你仍然可以为这项实用指南编写工作作出贡献：按照你感兴趣的项目的 README 中的说明参与，与社区分享你的数据集和结果，或为大家提供新的指南和工具。你的贡献弥足珍贵，能够帮助我们为所有人构建一个扎实而全面的资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a64d127b28f8e87",
      "translationZh": "如果你想参与其中，请加入 Hugging Face Discord 中的 #data-is-better-together 频道，告诉我们你想与大家一起构建什么！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a238f90e06def60",
      "translationZh": "我们期待与您一起构建更好的数据集！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
